# LF in the worktree on every platform, not just in the index.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, so a Windows checkout of this repo
# arrives with CRLF — and Biome's formatter, which has no line-ending option enabled here,
# then reports all eight source files as unformatted. `npm run lint` is red on Windows for
# a reason that has nothing to do with the code, while CI (ubuntu, LF) stays green: a gate
# that cries wolf on a whole checkout is one nobody reads.
#
# .editorconfig already says end_of_line = lf; this is the half that git enforces.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git must not touch it at all.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
